    {
     "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt269\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To place upon a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/shoe_tree\" title=\"shoe tree\">shoe tree</a>; to fit with a shoe tree; to stretch upon a shoe tree.",
